{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_chimes_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_chimes_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"落葉何歸","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chimes_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f5761bc14ea7afd8daff81c9e7f0886290cdbd2e08e59d57c2c58d2235764638","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"有一封信需要鐸鈴送到石橋村——一個連她自己也只是聽過名字的村落。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"鐸鈴，鐸鈴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，總算在你出城之前趕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿雲？怎麼了，我有什麼東西忘在郵局了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，是剛剛官府派人送來一封信，要送到石橋村。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"在郵局的信使沒一個人聽說過“石橋村”這個名字，互相打聽了好一下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"最後不知是誰說了一句“要是鐸鈴也不知道，那就沒人知道了”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"正好你前腳剛走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，交給我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐸鈴打開背囊，露出裡面塞得滿滿噹噹的信件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把信放進來吧。石橋村這名字我聽說過，知道大致方向，不過具體位置可能還得打聽打聽。我在送信的路上問清就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"這次你送完信是回玉門還是龍門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門。最近龍門積壓的往山區寄的信件比玉門多多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那等你送完信回來，我請你吃最近一直在廣告的辣椒老媽冰淇淋，據說是走香辣路線的，一點都不甜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是冰淇淋不該是甜的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿雲","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，甜的吃膩了就吃點辣的，這就是流行嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"還是出城送信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，包就不查了。上次看你把那些信小心翼翼拿出來又整整齊齊塞回去，我都替你嫌麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，老張要我替他謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"就是自己老家鎮子搬遷過一次，結果寄出去的信一直被退回郵局的那個大鬍子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你替他把好幾十封信一口氣送到，他收了回信之後高興得眼淚直流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想起來了……其實沒什麼的，都是舉手之勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那也得謝謝你。一路小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"在移動城市裡待久了，人就容易忘了還有“外面”這回事。\n可“外面”其實真的很近，近到稍微往航道外走上幾里路，人就會和風沙鼻子碰鼻子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，修馳道辛苦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"呦，這不是斷角信使嘛！怎麼啦，村裡來信了？是給我的，還是給我們工地哪個小姑娘小伙子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確有信，不過是從龍門送來的津貼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"津貼啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像不太高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼會，出來工作不就是為了多賺幾個錢改善生活嘛！我就是有點擔心。村裡上次來信已經是兩個月前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上個月還路過你們村，大家都好得很哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你先別忙著走，留下吃頓晚飯，再住上一晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次要送的信還不少耶，要不我還是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"客氣什麼！就算沒信大家也喜歡你過來，聽你講移動城市裡的事特別有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好今天又發了津貼，我請他們早點準備好飯，再找幾個年輕人陪你聊天！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"出城辦事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，辦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩把包開一下，安全檢查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，有件事想問一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天中午是不是有個斷了角的豐蹄信使出了城？她往哪邊走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“見字……如面，我在龍門……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿芳，你認識字，過來幫我看看這說的是什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是個什麼東西，手電筒？家裡有手電筒了，從龍門寄個這東西幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嬸嬸，這哪是手電筒，那是望遠鏡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是攝影機。我想拍一拍大家的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是能錄電視的那個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……差不多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我可得好好打扮打扮……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別人總說工作久了人就會麻木，他們還說什麼事都是這樣，經歷得多了就會習以為常。\n但我在大山和移動城市之間來來回回，送的最多的就是家信。\n這個月的家書和上個月的很難有什麼區別，無非是雨多下了幾天，麥子多收了幾斗。\n但只要家還在，人們就還是會寫一封又一封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，您知道石橋村怎麼走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道它在北邊，實際位置不太清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石橋村？我沒什麼印象。我在村裡幫你問問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，我們也不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過據說邊蹄村有個小伙子是從石橋村過去投靠親戚的，他也許知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邊蹄村……正好，我也有信要送到那去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不多坐坐了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了。再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老鄉，老鄉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你是誰啊，我怎麼沒見過你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那位信使是不是說她要去石橋村？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒是沒錯——欸，你怎麼又要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我家就在石橋村旁邊，我去幫她帶路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石橋村來的……你是說阿良？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿良，快來，有人找你問路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往北，過北墳村十多里後，有一棵好幾個人才能合抱的枯樹，從那裡進山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翻過去之後是一條人走出來的雙岔路，向右一直走，走差不多一天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我記住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼複雜，真虧你記得住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……向左走能走到我家鄉的村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就說嘛，你這孩子看著很樸實，像我們山裡出來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你家那邊怎麼樣，還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……已經荒了。大家都搬進城做工去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，前幾年年景不行，我們村也想過差不多的事，不過好歹挺過來了。你一路小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，剛才那個信使——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你找她有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想去石橋村，剛剛遠遠聽你們說該怎麼過去，可是沒聽清……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北墳村到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總共兩封送到北墳村的信，剩下一封……就是要送去石橋村的那一封了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡怎麼聚著好多人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家這是在……讀公告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們村終於要搬了。有個新建的移動地塊在招工，說是負責建築的人等地塊建好之後，可以繼續在城裡負責維護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不，公告已經貼出來了，過幾天就有車隊來接我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們的信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都給我吧，等大家各自回家了，我去把信給他們。多謝你這麼多年一直送信給我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你怎麼還往北走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩一封寄到石橋村的信，我得送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石橋村？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石橋村上個月就說要搬，現在那邊還有沒有人都不好說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這消息確定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們要搬是板上釘釘的事，車隊前幾天也進山了。不過這幾天我們沒見有車隊從山裡出來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就還趕得上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是別去了，那邊路又遠，又不知道他們還在不在，萬一遭了賊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您的消息，我現在跑過去，應該還趕得上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕陽西下，狹窄的道路兩側，群山綿延開去。\n向北十餘里，我見到那棵枯樹，轉了幾個彎走進山中，翻山越嶺，一路走到這個岔路口。\n我當年是從這裡出來的，但現在……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……各位，你們擋路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我們是來收信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我包裡沒有寄給你們的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不對吧？我可聽說你包裡的信是寄去石橋村的。石橋村就在前面，你把信給我，我送去村子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，軟的不吃吃硬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"把信給我們。就一張紙片，別磨磨蹭蹭的，交出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要搶的話就來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"敢跟我們作對，你翅膀硬了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們見過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話少說，這次老大不在，我們可不會手下留情！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"架勢學得倒不錯，就是不知道你刀頭到底見沒見過血……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"躲得還挺快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，這小妮子來真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼！我們一起上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小妮子如此不懂事，一個破送信的罷了，拼什麼命啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喘息）……我沒什麼好跟你們說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）老哥，對面還挺難拿下，要不我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）哼，也只能這麼著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們各退一步好不好？我跟你講講為什麼我們要跟你過不去，你再好好想想跟我們拼命到底值不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己送的是誰的信嗎？那是我們老大被抓之後寄出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"老大的老家就在石橋村，那個村子早就快荒得沒人了。要不是你之前到處打聽石橋村怎麼走，我們也不可能盯上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰信你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們跟你打生打死，就為了一張不知道哪來的破紙片，我們至於嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"實話告訴你，被抓之前老大剛藏了一批金銀細軟，他好不容易從龍門寄出來這封信，裡面肯定有名堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"把信交出來，等找到老大藏著的財寶，我們分你一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想都別想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，我再告訴你一件事，我們可是放過你一條生路的。那時候你角還沒斷呢，也還沒背著背上這把刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"想起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……就是我遇到的第一伙盜匪？蒙著我的眼睛，燒了我的信的那一伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"還能有誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是老大不想惹麻煩，又看你一個沒了家的小姑娘可憐，你以為殺個官差算多大點事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐……有什麼可憐的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你以為我們為什麼覺得你可憐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"真正有能耐的大盜都在移動城市裡幹大買賣，我們要不是沒了家，誰會來這種荒山野嶺裡劫道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"現在偏巧又是你給老大送這封信，我們也算有緣。隔這麼多年再見面，別鬧得不好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）如果你們真覺得這算緣分，最好現在就讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼聽不懂人話呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這把刀是我在被你們搶過之後才買的，別逼我真把它用在你們身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，兄弟們，小妮子自己找死，這可不怪我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"她在護著那個包！朝她背上砍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"反應倒快……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……最好趕緊走。那兩個人沒受致命傷，還能救得起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的底已經給你交了，你不跟我們一起幹，我們不可能放你活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小妮子，你腿都軟了。乖乖把信交出來跟我們走，說不定還能賺一筆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想……想都別想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你看你，說話都不穩了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡詐的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咕啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一刀，砍的是，手臂……下一刀就不一定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，一個信使放倒了我們三個人。但你也就這樣了。把刀放下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我說把刀放下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，還有幫手？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"撤，撤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……沒事。你又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那封信……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐸鈴往後退了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風塵僕僕的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，著急了。這是我的證件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門近衛局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長話短說，希望你能配合我的工作，和我一起回龍門，等我們檢查完這封信之後再把它寄出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這封信……到底怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這信是一名落網的盜匪頭子寄出來的，他說這是他寄給石橋村母親的家書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們查過了，他確實是石橋村人。順便，他供出來的第一件案子就是劫了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙從離家起就再沒回去過，已經十多年了。考慮到他時日無多，我們也沒多作干涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十幾年沒回過家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他自己說是免得牽連家裡人，實際原因……誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧的是，差不多在你出城的同時，我們突然查出他還跟其他的案子有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來，我們就必須認真考慮這封信不是家書，而是在傳遞訊息的可能性了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可……我馬上就要送到了。有沒有可能是個誤會，這真的只是一封普通的家書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是為了確認這個才一路追著你過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官先生，這裡向右走是石橋村，向左走就是我的故鄉……那裡已經什麼都沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石橋村馬上也要搬走了。我還知道我的家書該寄到哪裡，可這個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不回龍門真的不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，如果你無論如何都不願先回一趟龍門，我也可以在這裡開信檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但萬一這封信裡真有什麼鬼，或是我出了什麼意外，你都是要擔責的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那傢伙搶過你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和案子沒關係，只是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個十幾年沒回過家，而且再也回不去的人……我願意相信他寄出的最後一封信只是一封普普通通的家書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那個攝影機能用嗎？能用的話麻煩把檢查的全過程拍下來，這樣我們都好交差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……這封信到底是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人把信規規整整地折好，塞回信封，然後把信封遞回我手裡，拍了拍我的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它送到它該去的地方吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"我知道山的那邊還是山，石橋村的車隊出發了也只會和我迎面碰上，但我慢不下來。\n我覺得自己正在趕去見最後一位還沒搬家的老鄰居。\n到得早些，我們還能一起喝碗茶水，聊聊天。到得晚些，就只能看見背影了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼……趕上了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，你是哪位？來給親戚送行的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是……信使，有一封從龍門寄到石橋村的信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龍門？辛苦你了。給我看一眼信封，我問問已經上了車的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這下不巧了，這封信好像是給趙大娘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不巧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別，姑娘，你別慌，不是你想的那樣。趙大娘沒事，就是上了歲數，眼花耳背，人也糊塗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前村裡人和她說好了，車隊一到大家就一起出發，可她現在怎麼都不願走，跟小孩子發脾氣似的，說我們騙她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車隊首領","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這封信，我不知道她還能不能讀啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，我先把信交到趙大娘手上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰？誰來了？誰來我也不走！你們都來騙我！什麼移動城市，什麼電話，什麼城際網路——都來騙我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們就想像騙了二牙似的騙我也走，我不走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是來勸您走的，我是來送信的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不走！打死我也不走，我得在這裡等著……我不愛吃甜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？你怎麼進我家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大娘，我是個信使，我來送信給您。您的兒子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不認識字，被人騙了一輩子……認識又有什麼用，二牙認識字，二牙也被騙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這封信應該就是二牙寄給您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信……二牙寄什麼信，他從來不給我寫信……什麼信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這樣，我把他的信讀給您聽，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽……聽信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聵的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐸鈴","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“媽，對不起，十幾年了，我沒回過家，連一封信也沒寄給你過……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"媽，對不起，十幾年了，我沒回過家，連一封信也沒寄給你過。\n我怕拖累你，也不知道該寫什麼。\n我走了歪路，害了不少人，自己這些年也過得糊里糊塗，跟生了一場大病似的。\n別人都說路是自己走的，要賴只能賴自己，可我寧願賴當年來村子裡那個小販，賴他帶了一盒冰淇淋。\n真甜啊，媽，這都多少年了我還記著那味道。包裝上寫著“冰淇淋”的東西，怎麼就那麼甜，怎麼就那麼好吃呢？\n以前我最愛吃棗，在那之後，最大最紅的棗我也不碰了，我就想吃冰淇淋。\n當時你就罵我，說我跟著魔了似的。最後我可能真著魔了，就為了這點冰淇淋偷偷跑了出去。\n得了第一筆錢之後，我立刻給自己買了一整箱冰淇淋，什麼味道都有。可我吃壞了肚子，也沒再吃出那種勾魂的甜味來。\n現在我的事定下來了，這下我真沒辦法回家看你了。但你別想我。我一切都好。\n你要是真想我，你就在房後栽一棵棗樹吧，就當那是我了。春天棗樹發新葉，那就是我睡醒了，秋天棗子落地裡，那就是我吃了。\n棗樹上的刺要是扎疼你了，那就是我鬧脾氣。你打我也行，罵我也行，但我的根就扎在那，我哪裡也不去，我一直陪著你。\n就這樣吧。就當我回來了。\n讀到最後，我緊緊咬著自己的牙關，不讓自己哭出聲來。而老人只是轉過身，慢吞吞地挪著步子，走進了自家後院。\n小院中央已經有一棵經過精心侍弄的樹，上面掛滿了棗，青的，紅的。\n老人一掌打在棗樹的枝葉之間，尖刺劃破了她的手，眼淚爬過她佈滿皺紋的臉。\n片刻的沉默過後，老人轉身朝車隊的方向走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]}]}
